From 4f3112dfa96ccc703f8d8b4abb83267a7804c7c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julius Marminge <julius0216@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:36:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] fix(web): arrow and page keys scroll the conversation
 after a click or F6

Focus the timeline scroller so native keyboard scrolling works after a
click or workspace focus navigation. Keep its keyboard focus on window
return and draw the focus ring around the conversation region. Do not
restore the empty region ahead of a newly mounted timeline.

Upstream: https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code/pull/27209
Upstream-Head: af39cb731be45f64815ae9bc792066170689b94b

Backported to v0.1.7: refresh context and browser test imports.
Squashes the four upstream commits and retains their regression tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
